      ],
      "SPECIAL ABILITIES": [
        "Lunge (ex) A mantis's limbs are capable of reaching much farther than normal for a creature of its size. As a full-attack action, it can make a single attack with its claws at double its normal reach. When a mantis attacks with a claw in this manner, it gains a +4 bonus on its attack roll. A mantis cannot make attacks of opportunity with its lunge.",
        "Mandibles (ex) A mantis that grabs a foe can make a bite attack against that foe as a secondary attack. The mantis's bite is a +12 attack that inflicts 1d8+2 points of damage on a hit.",
        "Razor-sharp Claws (ex) A mantis' claw attacks have an increase critical range by 1 and damage size increased by 2.",
        "Sudden Strike (ex) A mantis is particularly adept at moving quickly when its foes are surprised. During a surprise round, a giant mantis may act as if it had a full round to act, rather than just one standard action."
      ]
